===
str_to_bytes
Converts a string to a list of byte values (integers 0-255).
Each character is converted to its UTF-8 byte representation.

str_to_bytes(s)

str_to_bytes("ABC")    # [65, 66, 67]
===
bytes_to_str
Converts a list of byte values back to a string.

bytes_to_str(bytes)

bytes_to_str([65, 66, 67])    # "ABC"
===
bytes_new
Creates a new byte list of the given size, filled with the specified value.

bytes_new(size, val)

bytes_new(4, 0)    # [0, 0, 0, 0]
===
bytes_get
Returns the byte value at the given index.

bytes_get(bytes, i)

bytes_get([65, 66, 67], 1)    # 66
===
bytes_length
Returns the length of a byte list.

bytes_length(bytes)

bytes_length([65, 66, 67])    # 3
===
bytes_slice
Returns a slice of the byte list from start (inclusive) to end (exclusive).

bytes_slice(bytes, start, end)

bytes_slice([65, 66, 67, 68], 1, 3)    # [66, 67]
